    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Ah! My Goddess: The Adventures of Mini-Goddess",
        "jpn": "ああっ女神さまっ 小っちゃいって事は便利だねっ"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "A large collection consisting of the adventures of the Goddesses featured in the anime and manga series Ah My Goddess. Parodies of other works, and a large number of jokes pervade this series of shorts in which the Goddesses torture and hang out with their friend Gan the rat.",
        "jpn": "ある日、平凡な大学生の元へ舞い降りた三人の女神たち。\r\n彼女たちは人々の幸せのためにいろいろな力を使います。\r\nなかでも、小さくなる力を使ったのが、このお話 … 。"
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Ah! My Mini Goddess",
        "The Adventures of Mini Goddess"
    ],
    "Modified": "2025-05-26",
